00:05:31,578 --> 00:05:37,578
All he needed was a lucky break. Then one day she moved in.

2
00:11:03,157 --> 00:11:09,157
Vision Quest is a drama, romance film directed by Harold Becker.

3
00:16:34,736 --> 00:16:40,736
After deciding he needs to do something meaningful with his life, high school wrestler Louden Swain sets out on a mission to
drop weight and challenge the area's undefeated champion, which creates problems with his teammates and health.

4
00:22:06,315 --> 00:22:12,315
Matters are complicated further when Louden's father takes in an
attractive female drifter who's on her way to San Francisco.

5
00:27:37,894 --> 00:27:43,894
Louden Swain, played by Matthew Modine.

6
00:33:09,473 --> 00:33:15,473
Carla, played by Linda Fiorentino.

7
00:38:41,052 --> 00:38:47,052
Larry Swain, played by Ronny Cox.

